            "type": "domain",
            "text": "The TIR domain mediates NAD(+) hydrolase (NADase) activity. Self-association of TIR domains is required for NADase activity (Probable). The TIR domain alone is active and produces cADPR (residues 134-267) (PubMed:36048923).",
